  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v8.3.0\n\n\t\tADDED\n\t\t- Variable reference support with &varname notation. In-place mutation without pushing a copy onto the stack. Significant performance gain on large lists, records, data, and strings. Supported primitives: +, set, get, butfirst, butlast, last, first, sub, size.\n\t\t- Host function detection at parse time, avoiding delegate dispatch overhead at runtime.\n\t\t- New char-> primitive: returns the ASCII code of a single string character.\n\t\t- Explicit static variable access with @varname notation. Resolved at parse time, eliminating runtime lookup overhead.\n\t\t- foreach loop now supports iteration over string characters.\n\n\t\tCHANGED\n\t\t- Dictionary lookups now use TryGetValue instead of ContainsKey + retrieval (all runtime dictionaries).\n\t\t- Variable and function names must now start with a letter or underscore _.\n\t\t- Synchronous primitives refactored: spurious async/await Task.CompletedTask replaced with Task.FromResult(). No behavioral change.\n\t\t- Removed systematic primitive cloning during execution.\n\t\t- Removed all LINK calls during execution.\n\t\t- Optimized primitive dictionaries for faster lookup.\n\n\t\tFull changelog: https://github.com/Sydney680928/mogwai/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
